[gd_scene format=3 uid="uid://cxn2qnukdhggq"]

; Marigold — the old, dignified house cat who grants DASH in Room 3.
; Built exactly like patch.tscn / pip.tscn: an npc.gd root + an AnimatedSprite2D
; child holding her 24-frame idle. To add more of her animations later, just add
; a same-named animation to the SpriteFrames in the editor (no code changes).

